    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκου-στικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for hearing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.13U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴσθησις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.37f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.23.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρος ἀ.</span> orifice <i>of
				ear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.455
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>faculiy of hearing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				426a7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ready to hear</i>, c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1103a3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.1.13
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mus.</u>
					p.107
				</span></i>
			 K., <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.355
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκουσματικός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gell.
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			= sq., Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1281
			</span></i>.</div>
